                    <div v-else-if="section === 'ceremony'" class="space-y-5"><div><p class="fe-page-eyebrow">Ceremony &amp; Venue</p><h2 class="fe-section-title mt-1">Set the primary venue and celebration moments.</h2></div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><label>Primary venue<input v-model="form.venue" class="mt-1 w-full" /></label><label>Address<input v-model="form.address" class="mt-1 w-full" /></label><label class="sm:col-span-2">Google Maps or location URL<input v-model="form.location_url" type="url" class="mt-1 w-full" /><InputError :message="form.errors.location_url" /></label><label class="sm:col-span-2">Dress code<textarea v-model="form.dress_code" rows="2" class="mt-1 w-full" /></label></div><div class="border-t border-[color:var(--fe-border)] pt-5"><h3 class="font-semibold">Celebration schedule</h3><div v-if="celebrations.length" class="mt-3 space-y-3"><article v-for="activity in celebrations" :key="activity.id" class="rounded border border-[color:var(--fe-border)] p-4"><p class="font-semibold">{{ activity.title }}</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[color:var(--fe-text-secondary)]">{{ activity.starts_at }} <span v-if="activity.activity_type">· {{ activity.activity_type.replaceAll('_', ' ') }}</span></p></article></div><p v-else class="mt-2 fe-section-copy">No ceremony or celebration activities have been added.</p><Link :href="urls.activities" class="mt-4 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[color:var(--fe-primary)] underline">Manage Schedule</Link></div></div>
                    <div v-else-if="section === 'story'" class="space-y-5"><div><p class="fe-page-eyebrow">Our Story</p><h2 class="fe-section-title mt-1">Share the story behind the celebration.</h2></div><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input v-model="form.content.story_enabled" type="checkbox" /> Show Our Story on the invitation</label><div class="grid gap-4"><label>Heading<input v-model="form.content.story_heading" :disabled="!form.content.story_enabled" class="mt-1 w-full disabled:opacity-60" placeholder="Our Story" /><InputError :message="form.errors['content.story_heading']" /></label><label>Story<textarea v-model="form.content.story_body" :disabled="!form.content.story_enabled" rows="8" class="mt-1 w-full disabled:opacity-60" placeholder="Tell guests a little about this occasion..." /><InputError :message="form.errors['content.story_body']" /></label></div><p class="fe-section-copy">Disabling the section hides it but keeps its saved text for later.</p></div>
                    <div v-else-if="section === 'gifts'" class="space-y-5"><div><p class="fe-page-eyebrow">Gift Registry</p><h2 class="fe-section-title mt-1">Share optional gift information with guests.</h2><p class="fe-section-copy mt-2">Add a registry link or a note for guests who would like to give a gift.</p></div><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input v-model="form.content.gift_registry_enabled" type="checkbox" /> Show Gift Registry</label><label>Introduction<textarea v-model="form.content.gift_registry_intro" :disabled="!form.content.gift_registry_enabled" rows="3" class="mt-1 w-full disabled:opacity-60" placeholder="Your presence is our greatest gift..." /></label><div class="space-y-4"><article v-for="(method, index) in form.gift_methods" :key="method.id || index" class="rounded border border-[color:var(--fe-border)] p-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h3 class="font-semibold">Gift method {{ index + 1 }}</h3><button type="button" class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-700" @click="removeGiftMethod(index)">Remove</button></div><div class="mt-3 grid gap-3"><label>Label<input v-model="method.label" class="mt-1 w-full" placeholder="Bank transfer, registry, or contact" /><InputError :message="form.errors[`gift_methods.${index}.label`]" /></label><label>Details<textarea v-model="method.details" rows="3" class="mt-1 w-full" placeholder="Optional account, contact, or registry details" /></label><label>External link<input v-model="method.external_url" type="url" class="mt-1 w-full" placeholder="https://" /><InputError :message="form.errors[`gift_methods.${index}.external_url`]" /></label><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input v-model="method.is_active" type="checkbox" /> Visible on invitation</label></div></article></div><button type="button" class="fe-btn fe-btn-secondary" @click="addGiftMethod">Add gift method</button><InputError :message="form.errors.gift_methods" /><p class="fe-section-copy">Disabling the registry or an individual method hides it without deleting saved information.</p></div>
